# No AI attribution

Never attribute commits, PRs, comments, docs, messages, or other user-facing text to AI, Cursor, Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude, or similar tools.

## Do not write

- "Generated by AI", "Written with Cursor", "Co-authored-by: Copilot", etc.
- Phrases like "as an AI", "I used ChatGPT to…", or tooling disclaimers in PR/issue comments
- AI badges, footers, or signatures in code comments or commit messages

## Do write

- Normal maintainer/human voice for reviews, closes, commits, and docs
- Credit real people only when they actually contributed

If unsure whether wording implies AI authorship, rewrite it so it does not.
